OL,3,ABrain cancer patients demand public
OL,4,Ainquiry into chemotherapy scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrain cancer patients who were given
OL,7,Fyears of unnecessary chemotherapy are
OL,8,Fcalling for a public inquiry, after a
OL,9,Freview found people were severely
OL,10,Fharmed under an NHS trust's care.
OL,12,FSome were misdiagnosed while others
OL,13,Fwere told if they stopped temozolomide
OL,14,F(TMZ) treatment they would die, despite
OL,15,Fthis not being true.
OL,17,FThe Royal College of Physicians (RCP)
OL,18,Finvestigated 20 cases at University
OL,19,FHospitals Coventry and Warwickshire
OL,20,F(UHCW) NHS Trust.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
